OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FReform UK's Robert Jenrick has said
OL,8,Fhis party followed all electoral
OL,9,Frules, after fresh reports over
OL,10,Ffunding linked to convicted fraudster
OL,11,FGeorge Cottrell.
OL,13,FThe Guardian reported that wealthy
OL,14,Fbanker Cottrell transferred more than
OL,15,F$2 million (approximately #1.5
OL,16,Fmillion) to his mother before she then
OL,17,Fdonated parts of this sum to Reform UK
OL,18,Fin 2024.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785449892
OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FThe party's finances have come under
OL,8,Fmedia scrutiny over recent weeks, and
OL,9,Fthe Metropolitan Police are looking at
OL,10,Fwhether donors might have circumvented
OL,11,Frestrictions on the sources of
OL,12,Fpolitical funding.
OL,14,FWhen asked by ITV News Political
OL,15,FCorrespondent Romilly Weeks about the
OL,16,Ftransfer of $2 million from Mr
OL,17,FCottrell to his mother, Jenrick
OL,18,Finsisted, "Reform is certain that all
OL,19,Fthe electoral rules were followed".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785449892
OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FHe said: "If you've got a question for
OL,8,FMr Cottrell, then I think you have to
OL,9,Fdirect that to him."
OL,11,FWatch Robert Jenrick face questions on
OL,12,FReform's association with the Cottrell
OL,13,Ffamily.
OL,15,FMs Cottrell is thought to have
OL,16,Freceived one deposit of $1.4 million
OL,17,Fand then two tranches of more than
OL,18,F$300,000 each.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
