OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FWhen asked about the deposits, she
OL,8,Fallegedly told bankers the money came
OL,9,Ffrom her son.
OL,11,FShe received the money around 24-72
OL,12,Fhours before she made donations to
OL,13,FReform UK directly or to the company
OL,14,FBritain Means Business, according to
OL,15,FThe Guardian.
OL,17,FThe Met's investigation is in relation
OL,18,Fto donations to the party from Britain
OL,19,FMeans Business, which is a fundraising
OL,20,Fvehicle directed by Reform UK's deputy
OL,21,Fleader Richard Tice.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785449892
OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FThe Times previously reported that the
OL,8,Ffirm gave Reform two donations of
OL,9,F#250,000 in the run-up to the 2024
OL,10,Fgeneral election, which Tice has
OL,11,Fpreviously said was paid by Ms
OL,12,FCottrell.
OL,14,FReports also suggest she gave #1
OL,15,Fmillion to the company in June 2024,
OL,16,Fwith half of that sum being given to
OL,17,FReform.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
