OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785449892
OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FMr Cottrell is a convicted criminal
OL,8,Fwho provided funding for Nigel
OL,9,FFarage's security and staffing in the
OL,10,Fyear before he was elected and has
OL,11,Fbeen a friend of Farage for several
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FWhen questioned about their
OL,15,Frelationship, Farage has previously
OL,16,Fsaid: "I don't dump trusted friends
OL,17,Funless they betray me - it's as simple
OL,18,Fas that."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785449892
OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FFarage resigned as an MP after
OL,8,Fmounting scrutiny over financial
OL,9,Fsupport given to him, including that
OL,10,Fof the Cottrell family, and said he
OL,11,Fhad "not broken the law in any way at
OL,12,Fall" or "misused public money".
OL,14,FA Reform UK spokesman said: "Reform
OL,15,Ftakes pride in its stringent vetting
OL,16,Fof donations and always ensures that
OL,17,Fthe Electoral Commission guidelines on
OL,18,Fdonations, as set out in the Political
OL,19,FParties, Elections and Referendums Act
OL,20,F2000, are strictly followed, as has
OL,21,Fbeen the case with all donations."
OL,26,@vD@]OU}D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
