OL,3,CJenrick insists Reform UK followed
OL,4,Celectoral rules after fresh donation
OL,5,Cscrutiny
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FAt the weekend, a Met spokesperson
OL,13,Fsaid: "An investigation was launched
OL,14,Fin February 2025 after a referral was
OL,15,Fmade to the Metropolitan Police by the
OL,16,FElectoral Commission relating to
OL,17,Fdonations made to a political party
OL,18,Fahead of the 2024 UK general election.
OL,26,@uD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
